~ start

Narrator: Welcome to Milka VN! 🥛 [#bg=milky_meadow, #show=milka_chan@right, #anim=milka_chan:idle?loop, #sfx=open]
Narrator: A gentle breeze sweeps across the creamy meadow, carrying the sweet scent of fresh milk. [#sfx=confirm]

Milka: "Nya~ Welcome traveler! I'm Milka-chan, your milky guide!" [#show=milka_chan:smile@center, #anim=milka_chan:bounce, #sfx=click]
Milka: "I'm so excited to meet you today!" [#anim=milka_chan:idle?loop]

Milka: "This is just the beginning. You can write your own story now." [#show=milka_chan]
Milka: "Replace my placeholder art with your own character sprites in 'assets/characters/'."

- "Tell me about the backgrounds!"
    Milka: "Look! This is the cozy café parlor background!" [#bg=cafe_parlor, #show=milka_chan:smile@center, #sfx=open]
    Milka: "Replace these SVG placeholders with your own beautiful WebP backgrounds." [#sfx=confirm]
    => branch_continue

- "What about animations?"
    Milka: "Oh! Watch me shake with excitement!" [#show=milka_chan:surprised@center, #anim=milka_chan:shake, #sfx=error]
    Milka: "And here's a cheerful bounce!" [#show=milka_chan:smile@center, #anim=milka_chan:bounce, #sfx=click]
    Milka: "I can also nod thoughtfully~" [#anim=milka_chan:nod, #sfx=confirm]
    => branch_continue

- "Show me all the sound effects!"
    Milka: "Let me play through all the preserved SFX!" [#show=milka_chan:smile@center, #sfx=click]
    Milka: "That's the save sound!" [#sfx=save]
    Milka: "Menu open sound!" [#sfx=open]
    Milka: "And close!" [#sfx=close]
    Milka: "Finally, the confirmation chime!" [#sfx=confirm]
    => branch_continue

~ branch_continue
Milka: "Look, the starry night has arrived!" [#bg=starry_night, #show=milka_chan:smile@center, #sfx=open]

Milka: "Now the stage is all yours." [#show=milka_chan]
Milka: "Edit 'dialogue/milka.dialogue' to write your own story."
Milka: "Add your characters to 'assets/characters/' and backgrounds to 'assets/backgrounds/'."

Milka: "Thank you for choosing Milka VN! May your stories be as sweet as chocolate milk! ✨🥛" [#show=milka_chan:smile@center, #anim=milka_chan:bounce, #sfx=confirm]

Narrator: [End of prologue — the stage is yours!]
=> END
